7
00:00:10,248 --> 00:00:12,627
Two players, one phone, side by side.

8
00:00:12,627 --> 00:00:15,649
One shoots on camera, one picks from the album.

9
00:00:15,649 --> 00:00:18,542
A local face detector clears each face before

10
00:00:18,542 --> 00:00:21,628
anything leaves the device, then the YouCam Skin

