Your worst metric picks your class.

13
00:00:26,394 --> 00:00:28,524
Weak pores forge the Crater Warden.

14
00:00:28,524 --> 00:00:31,020
Droopy eyelids crown the Drooping Regent.

15
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:33,758
Six battle stats come straight out of the raw

16
00:00:33,758 --> 00:00:36,741
