17
00:00:36,741 --> 00:00:36,984
you.

18
00:00:36,984 --> 00:00:40,509
Fifteen classes to unlock, one for every metric the

19
00:00:40,509 --> 00:00:41,270
API scores.

20
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:44,864
The API is deterministic to fourteen decimal places,

21
00:00:44,864 --> 00:00:47,975
