24
00:00:51,984 --> 00:00:53,976
Now put that face in the ring.

25
00:00:53,976 --> 00:00:57,030
Pick your fighter, lock it in, pass the phone.

26
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:57,960
Best of three.

27
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:00,477
Pick a stat and hope yours is higher.

28
00:01:00,477 --> 00:01:02,858
Best of three, and it is over fast.

29
00:01:02,858 --> 00:01:05,375
The loser gets roasted by the mirror.

30
00:01:05,375 --> 00:01:08,436
Every number on screen came out of a real API

31
